$i\leftarrow 1;$

repeat

Evaluate $\phi(\alpha_{i})$ ;

if $\phi(\alpha_{i}) > \phi(0)+c_{1}\alpha_{i}\phi^{\prime}(0)$ or $[\phi(\alpha_{i}) \geq \phi(\alpha_{i-1})$ and $i > 1 ]$

$\alpha_{*} \leftarrow\mathbf{zoom}(\alpha_{i-1},\alpha_{i})$ and stop;

Evaluate $\phi^{\prime}(\alpha_{i})$ ;

if $|\phi^{\prime}(\alpha_{i})| \leq -c_{2}\phi^{\prime}(0)$

set $\alpha_{*} \leftarrow\alpha_{i}$ and stop;

if $\phi^{\prime}(\alpha_{i}) \geq 0$

set $\alpha_{*} \leftarrow\mathbf{zoom}(\alpha_{i},\alpha_{i-1})$ and stop;

Choose $\alpha_{i+1} \in(\alpha_{i},\alpha_{\mathrm{max}})$ ;

$i\leftarrow i+1;$

end (repeat)
